                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I dove into some of the challenges of caring for our growing Indiana population living with kidney disease. Thanks to the caregivers at @DaVita Treatment Center in Greenwood for educating me on their good work. I cosponsored the Honor Our Living Donors Act in Congress to expand federal assistance for living organ donors\u2014 increasing the availability of life-saving kidneys for those in need.",
