                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined @GovBraun and House colleagues in welcoming Doug Collins, Secretary of our Veterans Administration, to Indy. @SecVetAffairs runs a department with 460,000 Federal employees and 170 VA hospitals \u2014 one of which serves a lot of veterans whom I\u2019m working hard to represent. We honored some standout VA employees. And we took questions from the press on VA funding for the replacement or renewal of aging hospitals like Roedebush. Big dollars. Big challenge. And yet it\u2019s crucial that we care for our veterans.",
                "text_lang": "en",
