                "text": "I joined Bound Tree Medical on a tour of their state of the art facility in Greenwood. They\u2019re a leading distributor of emergency medical equipment \u2014 servicing our first responders. The work done here provides our emergency personnel with the tools they need to provide life-saving assistance. I\u2019m proud to have such a facility in #CD6.",
